    "description": "API Development & System Integration: Designed and deployed robust APIs using C#, .NET, and Swagger to facilitate dynamic operations such as updates or deletions across computer objects, enhancing system interoperability and user experience.\n\nUI/UX Design: Led the creation of UI wireframes to streamline future product interfaces, significantly boosting the productivity of product teams and supporting stringent audit processes.\n\nCybersecurity Tool Development: Developed an interactive 'capture the flag' style educational tool for interns, utilizing .NET, Tuxedo, GAP hosting, and MS SQL database to enhance understanding of real-world cybersecurity applications.\n\nRelease Management: Managed bi-weekly UAT and production releases as Release Manager, focusing on meticulous planning, environment management, and the flawless execution of new features and fixes.\nApplication Enhancement: Initiated and led the enhancement of the Microsoft Defender application, improving management capabilities across all Windows systems within the firm.\n\nFrontend and Database Integration: Engineered sophisticated frontend solutions and backend database integrations using JavaScript, HTML, ReactJS, and Tuxedo, which improved user interactions and system functionality.\n\nModernization Projects: Directed the overhaul of the Dealworks application, transitioning UI components to React and enhancing the KYC processes, which significantly cut down on unnecessary license expenditures, saving the firm substantial financial resources annually.",
